<p><span class="body-text"><b>Likutay Moharan 9</b></span></p><p><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><span style="letter-spacing: 2.4pt"><b>Tehomet Yechasyumu</b></span></span></p><p><span class="body-text">[In the language of our Rebbe, his memory for blessing]&nbsp;</span><b>Depths covered them, they descended in depths etc.</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Exodus 15:5)</span></p><p><span class="body-text"><b>1.</b></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;Because main the vitality receive from the&nbsp;</span><u>tefillah</u><span class="body-text">&nbsp;</span><span class="body-text"><i>(prayer)</i></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Prayer to G-d of my life&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Psalms 42:9) and for this needs to pray with all his strength because when prays with all his strength and inserts his strength in letters of the&nbsp;</span><u>tefillah</u><span class="body-text">&nbsp;</span><span class="body-text"><i>(prayer)</i></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;then renewed his strength there in aspect of&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;New in the mornings much Your faith&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Lamentations 3:23) etc. because faith she&nbsp;</span><u>tefillah</u><span class="body-text">&nbsp;</span><span class="body-text"><i>(prayer)</i></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;And was his hands faith&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Exodus 17:12) its targum: spread in prayer</span></p><p><span class="body-text"><b>2.</b></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;And know, that there twelve tribes against twelve constellations (Tikkun 18, and in tikkun 21) and every tribe and tribe there to him version special and there to him gate special to enter through there his prayer and every tribe arouses in his prayer strength of his constellation that in twelve constellations and the constellation illuminates below and grows the plant and rest of his things the needed to him and this interpretation&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Steps star from Jacob and rises tribe from Israel&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Numbers 24:17) and rises this aspect of standing, aspect of prayer when tribe from Israel stands to pray by this arouses star and the star steps and strikes the things that grow as said our sages, their memory for blessing (Bereshit Rabbah, parashah 10). No to you herb from below that no to him star and angel from above, that strikes him and says to him: Grow! And this that said our sages, their memory for blessing (Pesachim 118a) difficult his sustenances as splitting of sea of reed and difficult his coupling [as splitting of sea of reed] etc. (Sotah 2a) because the sea of reed split to twelve splits against twelve tribes (Pirkei deRabbi Eliezer, 42, see Tikkun 21 59a) and children of Israel in their prayer cause coupling of Holy Blessed He and His Shekhinah as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Pave for rider of arabot&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Psalms 68:5) rider, this Holy Blessed He arabot, this His Shekhinah that mixed in her all the colors and according to the coupling that causes in his prayer so merits to his coupling and the prayer they twelve versions therefore the coupling as splitting of sea of reed that they twelve and also Israel sustain their father that in heaven in their prayer as it is written (Psalms 105:44):&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;And set it to Jacob for statute&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;and statute language of sustenance he (Beitzah 16a) and there is no standing but prayer (Berakhot 6b) and this interpretation&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Keep His testimonies and statute gave to them&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Psalms 99:7) testimony this prayer, as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Tribes of Yah testimony to thank to name of Hashem&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Psalms 122:4) also said our sages, their memory for blessing (Shevuot 30a): no testimony but in standing and standing this prayer that we testify on His unity and according to that sustain to his father in heaven in his prayer so given to him his sustenance and this: difficult sustenances as splitting of sea of reed that is sustenances divided to twelve paths according to twelve prayers tribes of Yah and needs to this merit great that merit man to raise his prayer through gate the belonging to his tribe and this that said Abba Binyamin (Berakhot 5b). All my days I was pained on two things: on my prayer that be adjacent to my bed that is as above, that pray through gate of his staff because there twelve staffs and every one there to him gate special and prayed on that not distance his prayer from his staff and this language of staff, because staff language of coupling as the statement adjacent: on my bed that be given etc. and bed he aspect of coupling also staff she aspect of sustenance as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;In my breaking to you staff of bread&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Leviticus 26:26) because twelve staffs cause coupling and sustain as above difficult their coupling and difficult his sustenances etc. also prayed on his tribe that merit to two tables and this is: and on my bed that be given between north to south and said our sages, their memory for blessing (Bava Batra 25b). One who wants to become wise etc., one who wants to become rich etc. and Jacob, that he included all the twelve tribes and was knowing every staff and staff in its root for this written in him (Genesis 49:33):&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;And Jacob gathered his feet to the bed&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;his feet this aspect of prayer as it is written&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;Righteousness before Him walks&quot;</b><span class="body-text">&nbsp;(Psalms 85:14) (see Berakhot 14b) that is, that was gathering all the prayers, every one to its root also was power in his hand to give portion from portions of world to Joseph as it is written (Genesis 48:22):&nbsp;</span><b>&quot;And